WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.917
Danny: He’s got me!

2
00:00:13.918 --> 00:00:15.424
Brad: Run!

3
00:00:15.425 --> 00:00:16.889
Danny: I can’t run!

4
00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.034
He’s got me!

5
00:00:19.035 --> 00:00:25.135
Tina: Well, do SOMETHING!

6
00:00:25.136 --> 00:00:27.955
Brad: Did that work?

7
00:00:27.956 --> 00:00:31.042
Tina: No. And now it’s got me!

8
00:00:31.043 --> 00:00:35.893
Danny: Brad, do something!

9
00:00:35.894 --> 00:00:41.811
Brad: I’m thinking.

10
00:00:41.812 --> 00:00:46.908
Danny: Think faster. Who knows where this creature is taking us!

11
00:00:46.909 --> 00:00:49.716
Brad: Well, it lives in the dark, right?

12
00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:52.841
Tina: It lives in a dark world, that’s for sure.

13
00:00:52.842 --> 00:00:58.440
Danny: Yeah. And it didn’t attack until I broke the flashlight.

14
00:00:58.441 --> 00:01:01.293
Brad: I think it’s afraid of the light!

15
00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:04.759
Tina: I wish you hadn’t broken that flashlight, Danny.

16
00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:06.797
Danny: Me too!

17
00:01:06.798 --> 00:01:12.023
Brad: So just make another flashlight!

18
00:01:12.024 --> 00:01:14.146
Danny: I’ve got a better idea.

19
00:01:14.147 --> 00:01:16.185
This monster scared us.

20
00:01:16.186 --> 00:01:22.879
It’s time to scare him.

21
00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.611
Brad: What are those?

22
00:01:24.612 --> 00:01:33.856
Danny: Just you wait.

23
00:01:33.857 --> 00:01:43.411
Tina: Fireworks! Danny, that’s brilliant!

24
00:01:43.412 --> 00:01:44.804
Danny: Ha-ha!

25
00:01:44.805 --> 00:01:45.976
Brad: I was right.

26
00:01:45.977 --> 00:01:48.217
Light is its enemy!

27
00:01:48.218 --> 00:01:52.378
Nice work, Danny.

28
00:01:52.379 --> 00:01:59.119
Danny: I’ve got just one more.

29
00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:02.065
Tina: It sure is pretty.

30
00:02:02.066 --> 00:02:05.515
Brad: Hey. There’s more than just silver and gold here.

31
00:02:05.516 --> 00:02:10.902
Brad: There are diamonds too.

32
00:02:10.903 --> 00:02:13.055
Brad: You know what’s cool?

33
00:02:13.056 --> 00:02:14.528
Tina: What?

34
00:02:14.529 --> 00:02:16.154
Brad: Come down here and look.

35
00:02:16.155 --> 00:02:21.479
You too, Danny.

36
00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:23.138
Brad: Do you see them?

37
00:02:23.139 --> 00:02:24.584
Tina: See what?

38
00:02:24.585 --> 00:02:27.496
Brad: Look at the rainbows.

39
00:02:27.497 --> 00:02:29.397
Danny: A rainbow!

40
00:02:29.398 --> 00:02:35.267
Brad: Yes, you can see all the colors of a rainbow when you. . .

41
00:02:35.268 --> 00:02:37.426
Tina: Danny . . . ?

42
00:02:37.427 --> 00:02:38.996
Danny: That’s it!

43
00:02:38.997 --> 00:02:40.310
Tina: What’s it?

44
00:02:40.311 --> 00:02:42.270
Danny: What Brad said!

45
00:02:42.271 --> 00:02:44.255
Brad: What did I say?

46
00:02:44.256 --> 00:02:48.155
Danny: I’ve figured out how we get to Ginormous!

47
00:02:48.156 --> 00:02:51.666
Tina: Danny, you’re going to have to explain!

48
00:02:51.667 --> 00:02:54.609
Danny: All these worlds have been about color.

49
00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:58.948
Danny: And our mission is to bring color back to Hopian’s world.

50
00:02:58.949 --> 00:03:06.341
Danny: But not just one color, all the colors─like a rainbow!
